      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "From 113 patients with ischemic stroke in 14.3% a direct and in 30.1% an indirect connection between cardiac diseases and ischemic stroke could be considered. The one and two dimensional echocardiography is a useful noninvasive method to identify possible cardiac causes of the ischemic stroke."},
